{"4753960":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Meow Squad: Incremental Fishing","steam_appid":4753960,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist Now~<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.poster.avif?t=1792993771\" width=604 height=50 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.webm?t=1792993771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.mp4?t=1792993771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/c59fd22021f0a4959f9a95f30cb707dd.avif?t=1792993771\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras_big\/c59fd22021f0a4959f9a95f30cb707dd.webp?t=1792993771 width=1560 height=464 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>30 Seconds a Round, Easy to Pick Up!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing and addictive fishing-themed incremental game that combines two gameplay modes: incremental fishing and arcade-style boss battles! Across five seas, catch fish, train your meow squad, and challenge the mysterious Overlords hidden beneath the waves!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishing &amp; Seas<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your net alongside your Meow Squad across five seas and frantically catch 18 types of marine life. Gather resources and build your strength. Accumulate bountiful resources and gradually unlock new seas from shallow waters down to the abyss, until you’ve conquered the entire ocean!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/a99854db964267cc8a8654211ed76781.poster.avif?t=1792993771\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/a99854db964267cc8a8654211ed76781.webm?t=1792993771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/a99854db964267cc8a8654211ed76781.mp4?t=1792993771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talent Tree<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources earned from fishing can be used to light up a massive talent tree, boosting your fishing abilities. Every choice makes your fishing journey more unstoppable, letting you deeply experience the joy of incremental progression!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/442dbb04c23cdbf5b9ffba771023b530.poster.avif?t=1792993771\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/442dbb04c23cdbf5b9ffba771023b530.webm?t=1792993771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/442dbb04c23cdbf5b9ffba771023b530.mp4?t=1792993771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Battles<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll encounter Overlords within the seas, each with unique battle mechanics, and plunge into intense, arcade-style boss fights. Each Overlord demands a different strategy. Defeat them to unlock new seas and push your adventure forward!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/a301ed0c919dfea62078c2839eea2d58.poster.avif?t=1792993771\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/a301ed0c919dfea62078c2839eea2d58.webm?t=1792993771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/a301ed0c919dfea62078c2839eea2d58.mp4?t=1792993771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nets &amp; Sailors<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously upgrade your fishing net to enhance your catching power, while four cat sailors each take control of a powerful turret, automatically blasting schools of fish. The seamless teamwork between sailors and nets puts your fishing firepower into overdrive!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/150f5956b33f86228e183a3d24f3c9cf.poster.avif?t=1792993771\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/150f5956b33f86228e183a3d24f3c9cf.webm?t=1792993771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/150f5956b33f86228e183a3d24f3c9cf.mp4?t=1792993771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collectibles<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While fishing, you have a chance to obtain 16 curious collectibles scattered across the seas. Gather them all to uncover the secrets of this ocean!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦀 5 colossal Overlords, delivering arcade-style boss battles<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐟️ 18 types of marine life<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐱 4 cat sailor fishing alongside you<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 Over 120 talents<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 5 seas with distinct styles<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎁 16 collectibles to discover<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕸️ 10 fishing net upgrades<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/c59fd22021f0a4959f9a95f30cb707dd.avif?t=1792993771\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras_big\/c59fd22021f0a4959f9a95f30cb707dd.webp?t=1792993771 width=1560 height=464 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>30 Seconds a Round, Easy to Pick Up!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing and addictive fishing-themed incremental game that combines two gameplay modes: incremental fishing and arcade-style boss battles! Across five seas, catch fish, train your meow squad, and challenge the mysterious Overlords hidden beneath the waves!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishing &amp; Seas<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your net alongside your Meow Squad across five seas and frantically catch 18 types of marine life. Gather resources and build your strength. Accumulate bountiful resources and gradually unlock new seas from shallow waters down to the abyss, until you’ve conquered the entire ocean!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753960\/extras\/a99854db964267cc8a8654211ed767